# --- Room 1/20 ---
dig Moonlit Thicket - Entrance
@desc Ancient ash trees tower overhead, their tangled canopy filtering the dim luminescence into dancing patterns on the forest floor. The air smells of ozone, and the ground is carpeted with cracked stone.
@tags/set room-zone:moonlit_thicket
@open south=south to Moonlit Thicket - Ledge
@open east=east to Moonlit Thicket - Stretch

# --- Room 2/20 ---
